<wpt lat="40.013886" lon="-105.294812"><name>Coffee: Boulder</name><desc>Mile 0. Fill up and have coffee before you go.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="39.883773" lon="-105.474153"><name>Way out: Left onto CO 119</name><desc>Mile 19. Too wet? CO 119 north through Nederland is 26 mi to Boulder, paved.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="39.865311" lon="-105.465965"><name>Fuel: Shell</name><desc>Mile 21.1.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="39.829794" lon="-105.552562"><name>Rough: Left onto Upper Apex Valley Road (CR 3)</name><desc>Mile 29.2. Keep right at 30.4. Short rougher bits.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="39.742640" lon="-105.512261"><name>Lunch: Idaho Springs</name><desc>Mile 44.5. Beau Jo's, 1517 Miner, pizza, from 11, 303-567-4376; Main Street Restaurant, 1518 Miner, 7 to 2:30 (weekends 3), 303-567-2788; Westbound &amp; Down, 1617 Miner, from 11 (weekends 8). Coffee: The Frothy Cup, 1510 Miner, from 7. Hours from listings, not confirmed.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="39.741563" lon="-105.503136"><name>Fuel: several on Colorado Boulevard</name><desc>Mile 45. Maverik and Shell downtown too.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="39.819696" lon="-105.510426"><name>Rough: Keep right onto Hughesville Road (CR 5)</name><desc>Mile 58.6. Keep left at 59.1; left on Juniper at 60.1. Short rough bits.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="39.838426" lon="-105.504055"><name>Way out: Right onto CO 119</name><desc>Mile 60.6. Home from here by CO 119 and Boulder Canyon: 31 mi, paved.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="39.900200" lon="-105.342671"><name>Check: Left onto CO 72. DECIDE: Gross Dam Road open?</name><desc>Mile 74. Fuel: Carl's Corner. Closed? Turn right instead, down to CO 93: 18 mi, paved.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="39.913655" lon="-105.351134"><name>Rough: Right onto Gross Dam Road (CR 77S)</name><desc>Mile 75.5. Dust, dam traffic. Keep left at 76.6 and 77.3.</desc></wpt>
